1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,980
This brings us to the final stage of our tour and a most welcome one: it's the company café.

2
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:11,870
We hope that you will be pleasantly surprised by the quality and range of food and coffee on offer here.

3
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:17,460
Why don't we all sit down and sample the coffee and cakes while I explain to you how the system works?

4
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:21,180
The café opens at eight for hot drinks and light snacks.

5
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:24,700
Full food service is offered from midday until one thirty.

6
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:30,895
On our right, you can see the cafeteria section, where you can choose your main meal at lunchtime.

7
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:36,170
Sandwiches and cakes may be purchased at all times from the cafe section on your left.

8
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:42,600
In order to take advantage of this excellent service, simply show your employee identity card to the cashier.

9
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:43,940
Are there any questions?
